%% Berry Exchange — Phase 5: agentic chat tool-calling loop (Task 21)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Buyer as Buyer (Browser)
    participant Widget as SPA Chat Widget
    participant API as POST /api/chat/conversations/{id}/messages (SSE)
    participant Loop as ChatAgent loop
    participant Claude as Claude (IChatAgentModel)
    participant Tools as ChatToolExecutor
    participant Svc as Listings / Reservations services
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Buyer->>Widget: type a message, send
    Widget->>API: POST content (opens SSE stream)
    API->>DB: append user ChatMessage
    API->>Loop: RunAsync(userId, history)

    loop up to MaxIterations
        Loop->>Claude: NextTurnAsync(systemPrompt, tools, history)
        Claude-->>Loop: AgentTurn (text? + tool_use[])
        opt tool calls present
            Loop--)API: yield AgentToolCallEvent(name)
            API--)Widget: data: {"type":"tool_call", "name": ...}
            Loop->>Tools: ExecuteAsync(userId, call)
            Tools->>Svc: search / get / check / reserve
            Svc->>DB: query / mutate
            DB-->>Svc: result
            Svc-->>Tools: result
            Tools-->>Loop: AgentToolResult
            Note over Loop: tool results appended to history<br/>as AgentToolResults, fed back next iteration
        end
        opt final text (no tool calls)
            Loop--)API: yield AgentTextEvent(text)
            API--)Widget: data: {"type":"text", "text": ...}
        end
    end

    Note over Loop: MaxIterations exceeded -> emits<br/>"too many steps" AgentTextEvent as the closing message

    API->>DB: append assistant ChatMessage (joined text parts)
    API--)Widget: data: {"type":"done"}
    Widget-->>Buyer: render streamed tool calls + final reply
